   2099  feff							; LaserHitTestBody — MOVED from bank0 (S5.4, entry tramp $FE86 -> `jmp $FF00`).
   2100  feff							; Contact-missile kill (redesign 2026-10-08): CollisionX = LaserX (cur M0
   2101  feff							; arg, stored by LaserInput .LaserGo), drawn M0 = [A-7, A]. The body tests
   2102  feff							; ONE tip cell for wall first, then the missile's OWN body box against each
   2103  feff							; live enemy — no piercing: first contact wins and the caller resets the
   2104  feff							; beam to the eye. Vertical: beam rows [RoomY+2, RoomY+3] vs enemy [Y,+7] ->
   2105  feff							; (RoomY-Y)+3 in [0..8]. Horizontal (same convention as CheckEnemyHit):
   2106  feff							; |eLo-lo| <= 7 via (d+7) in [0..14]; caller keeps arg in [0,159].
   2107  feff							; Fold-free: enemy records are level data in THIS bank — stage once, direct
   2108  feff							; `lda (FetchPtr),Y` for the type (was `jsr FoldIndirect`).
   2109  feff							; RESULT PROTOCOL (pads cannot nest from a pad body — the kill/lamp/wall
   2110  feff							; ACTIONS stay in bank0's LaserInput): every exit returns A + Z through
